%% 05 · Conversation runtime — server/runtime_graph.py and event-driven player
flowchart TD
  START["Customer starts Explore or Browse<br/>[ASK · one initial microphone permission, or typed input]"]:::ask
  INPUT["Continuous PCM capture + local speech onset<br/>[LIBRARY · live-voice.js / voice-worklet.js]<br/>AEC requested; capture generation owns ready/transcript/error events"]:::data
  STT["Realtime STT over private session WebSocket<br/>[LIBRARY · runtime_live.py / sarvam_stream.py]<br/>partials stop playback; stable final dispatches one question"]:::data
  INTAKE["One needs question; wait for a real reply<br/>[FUNCTION · player.js runIntake]<br/>retain actual customer wording"]:::fn
  OVERVIEW["Grounded overview in the selected voice<br/>[DATA · bundle.runtime.overview]<br/>10–15 second target measured from generated audio"]:::data
  PERSONALIZE["Explore graph node → pitch.plan_pitch<br/>[AGENT · Gemini → Claude → Runware]<br/>order reviewed slides; explicit priority revision may revisit selected seen proof"]:::agent
  ROUTE["Validate route and personalized segments<br/>[FUNCTION · pitch.py / player.js]<br/>initial pitch: first unseen fundamental before three-proof limit<br/>player fallback mirrors one-stop move; refinements/revisits unchanged"]:::fn
  PLAY["Narration owns the screen<br/>[FUNCTION · player.js / slide.js]<br/>one voice; reveal matching callout with each line; spoken question owns its wait"]:::fn
  STOP["Stop local audio and cancel old turn/delivery<br/>[FUNCTION · live-voice.js / runtime_live.py]<br/>save return point; discard stale turn/utterance/generation output"]:::fn
  ACK["Short acknowledgement when useful<br/>[DATA · selected-voice filler]<br/>retrieval starts concurrently; filler is not useful-answer latency"]:::data
  RETRIEVE["Retrieve pinned approved evidence<br/>[FUNCTION · knowledge.retrieve]<br/>BM25 + local ranking; request-local universal scope; pinned condition dependencies"]:::fn
  REASON["Answer, clarify, or request bounded tool<br/>[AGENT · runtime_graph.reason]<br/>history + explicit profile + evidence + tool results"]:::agent
  CHOICE{"Decision action?<br/>[FUNCTION · after_reason]"}:::dec
  TOOLS["Calculator or customer-selected public URL<br/>[FUNCTION · runtime_tools.py]<br/>exact operand units/basis + formula; safe source pages + whole table passages<br/>max 2 tool rounds / 4 calls; graph deadline 12 seconds"]:::fn
  VALIDATE["Validate sentences; retain supported portion<br/>[FUNCTION · runtime_graph.validate]<br/>IDs, quantities, scope, policy relations, estimate/web qualification<br/>guard is not general semantic entailment"]:::fn
  REPAIR["One optional composition repair<br/>[AGENT · runtime_graph._repair_composition]<br/>same approved evidence + precise rejection feedback; no tools or CTA<br/>only if at least 3 seconds remain inside the same 12-second deadline"]:::agent
  RECHECK["Revalidate repaired sentences<br/>[FUNCTION · validate_decision]<br/>accept fully checked useful content; partial repairs retain rejection telemetry<br/>otherwise retain original supported result; cancellation always wins"]:::fn
  PLAN["Checkpoint a versioned DeliveryPlan<br/>[DATA · runtime_state.py]<br/>snapshot, turn/utterance ID, result, next interaction; no audio in graph"]:::data
  VIEW["Evidence view: stay / jump / none<br/>[FUNCTION · deck.route_for + player.js]<br/>runtime-v1 answer starts directly on its evidence; no extra spoken bridge<br/>turn ownership and original return point stay stable"]:::fn
  SPEAK["Request selected-voice streaming delivery<br/>[LIBRARY · runtime_delivery.py → Sarvam Bulbul v3]<br/>validated answer first, PCM chunks second; cancel closes its socket"]:::data
  WAIT["Listen and wait<br/>[ASK · follow-up / reply / Continue / configured CTA]<br/>silence never resumes narration"]:::ask
  CORRECT["Explicit changed priority<br/>[FUNCTION · player.js]<br/>replan relevant proof; explicit reviewed revisits allowed; apply on Continue from closing"]:::fn
  RESUME["Continue → exact interrupted location<br/>[FUNCTION · resumeAfterQA]"]:::fn
  CTA["Customer selects next step + separately consents to contact<br/>[ASK · existing lead form]<br/>no model-triggered submission"]:::ask
  SAVE["Save heard transcript, timings, recap and consent<br/>[DATA · sessions / traces / runtime_metrics.py]<br/>missing/cancelled timings visible; small samples labelled"]:::data
  FAIL["Supported partial answer or temporary limitation<br/>[FUNCTION · bounded failure]<br/>no outage cached as a knowledge gap"]:::fn
  START --> INTAKE
  START --> INPUT --> STT
  INTAKE --> OVERVIEW
  INTAKE --> PERSONALIZE --> ROUTE
  OVERVIEW --> ROUTE --> PLAY
  STT --> STOP
  PLAY -- "typed interruption" --> STOP
  STOP --> ACK
  STOP --> RETRIEVE --> REASON --> CHOICE
  CHOICE -- "tools within budget" --> TOOLS --> REASON
  CHOICE -- "answer or clarification" --> VALIDATE --> PLAN
  VALIDATE -- "empty or rejected substantive draft; budget remains" --> REPAIR --> RECHECK --> PLAN
  REASON -- "deadline or unavailable" --> FAIL --> PLAN
  PLAN --> VIEW --> SPEAK --> WAIT
  PLAY -- "check-in" --> WAIT
  WAIT -- "question or reply" --> RETRIEVE
  WAIT -- "changed priority" --> CORRECT --> PERSONALIZE
  WAIT -- "Continue" --> RESUME --> PLAY
  WAIT -- "next step" --> CTA --> SAVE
  PLAY -- "Done / Stop" --> SAVE
  classDef agent fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#0b2a5b;
  classDef fn fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#052e16;
  classDef dec fill:#f3e8ff,stroke:#9333ea,color:#2a0a4a;
  classDef ask fill:#cffafe,stroke:#0891b2,color:#083344;
  classDef data fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#2a0a4a;
